# Journey to Bastok (San d'Oria 2-3, part 2) in Metalworks, a level 30 Warrior of San d'Oria with the mission current
# (a GM; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1's first mission out). Each of Chantain, Lutia, Grohm, Pius, Riault and
# Savae E Paleade is triggered at status 0, 7, 8, 9, 10 and 11. Status 0 and 7: Chantain 203, Lutia 202, Riault 201
# and Savae 208 (the zone's own events); Grohm 427 and Pius 356 (the mission's). Status 8 to 10: Chantain 217, Lutia
# 214, Riault 211 and Savae 208; Grohm 427 and Pius 356. Status 8: Pius plays 355, whose finish moves to status 9.
# Status 9: Grohm plays 426, whose finish moves to status 10. Status 11: Chantain 203, Lutia 202, Pius 350 and Riault
# 201 (the zone's own); Grohm 427 (the mission's); Savae plays 207, whose finish completes the mission and begins
# Journey Abroad.
lists Metalworks/Chantain/onTrigger Metalworks/Lutia/onTrigger Metalworks/Grohm/onTrigger Metalworks/Pius/onTrigger Metalworks/Riault/onTrigger Metalworks/Savae_E_Paleade/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/207 Metalworks/onEventFinish/355 Metalworks/onEventFinish/426 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=Metalworks pos=-18,-11,-27 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria JourneyToBastok2 current
login
trigger Chantain
finish-if-event
trigger Lutia
finish-if-event
trigger Grohm
finish-if-event
trigger Pius
finish-if-event
trigger Riault
finish-if-event
trigger Savae_E_Paleade
finish-if-event
